# tw-variants-ui

React + Tailwind + DaisyUI component library (ESM). **Full detail:** root `AGENTS.md`.

## Commands

- `npm install` — deps
- `npm run dev` — Storybook (port 6006)
- `npm run build` — library + CSS + themes to `dist/`
- `npm test` / `npm run test:ui` — Vitest
- `npm run lint` / `npm run format` / `npm run typecheck`
- `npm run generate:component` — Plop scaffold

## Layout

- `src/components/react/{Name}/{Name}.tsx` — components; barrel `src/components/react/index.ts`
- `src/common/` — shared variant helpers (e.g. `buttonVariants`)
- `src/themes/`, `src/tailwind-preset.js`, `src/styles/` — Tailwind/DaisyUI wiring
- `src/tokens/` — design tokens (Phase 1+)
- `src/stories/` — Storybook
- `generator/plopfile.js` — component generator

## Generator

New exports must use the hook in `index.ts`: `/* generator:new component */` — Plop appends here.

## Agent behavior

- Prefer small, task-scoped changes; match existing naming and imports.
- Do not remove the generator comment or break barrel exports.
